  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Level 5**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Rapid Alpha Decay**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Alien Metal**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2026-08-22.birds** (recommended): source not stated; 8 songs; 133 min [1]\n- **kglw2026-08-22**: source not stated; 8 songs; 133 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Moktar dropped out due to visa issues; Joey played percussion on Slow Jam 1 [1]\n- Van Halen vocal samples played at Level 5 start and Alien Metal end [2]\n- Blue Morpho appeared on printed setlist after Alien Metal but was not performed [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2026-08-22.birds**: taped by Birds; transferred by Birds; source: x2 Rode NT 5's in ORTF > Zoom H6 Handy Recorder [1]. Also: Two Rode NT5 mics in ORTF recorded to Zoom H6, converted to FLAC [1]\n- **kglw2026-08-22**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: ADK T7 Thor (ORTF, 8-1/2' high, ~90' from stage, directly in front of stage right array) > PMD661 (Oade concert mod) > 24/96 wav [2]",
